// The instructions the MIPS backend selects, in the order of the
// instructions that cpu entries cost: the enumerator, the mnemonic, and
// each form the backend emits as "OPERANDS | EFFECTS" in the spelling
// of instruction entries. Loading checks that the shipped instruction
// table defines them so and that no other model adds forms to them.
